  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-)\n\nIn this section, why should the properties be reported as configurable (this is the cross-origin case)?\n\nThey are not configurable in Safari or Chrome. Also, it you try to delete them, it will throw:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#windowproxy-delete\n",
